			"text": "多分、ちょうどその辺をどうしようしてたら。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:05,260",
				"to": "00:05:06,260"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 305260,
				"to": 306260
			},
			"text": "お願いします。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:06,260",
				"to": "00:05:07,260"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 306260,
				"to": 307260
			},
			"text": "ありがとうございます。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:07,260",
				"to": "00:05:08,260"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 307260,
				"to": 308260
			},
			"text": "おかしろい。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:08,260",
				"to": "00:05:24,390"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 308260,
				"to": 324390
			},
			"text": "電話の録音っていうのが、何か、電話線というのがアナログすぎて、案外難しいというのが、びっくりするんだけど。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:24,390",
				"to": "00:05:25,390"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 324390,
				"to": 325390
			},
			"text": "うん。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:25,390",
				"to": "00:05:27,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 325390,
				"to": 327360
			},
			"text": "すごい。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:27,360",
				"to": "00:05:29,230"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 327360,
				"to": 329230
			},
			"text": "増築ムービー。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:29,230",
				"to": "00:05:30,330"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 329230,
				"to": 330330
			},
			"text": "おお。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:30,330",
				"to": "00:05:31,330"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 330330,
				"to": 331330
			},
			"text": "おお。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:31,330",
				"to": "00:05:34,330"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 331330,
				"to": 334330
			},
			"text": "ちょっと、次目みたいな、あとで。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:34,330",
				"to": "00:05:36,330"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 334330,
				"to": 336330
			},
			"text": "3回と4回の間。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:36,330",
				"to": "00:05:38,330"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 336330,
				"to": 338330
			},
			"text": "建築法的に大丈夫だったんだね。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:38,330",
				"to": "00:05:40,330"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 338330,
				"to": 340330
			},
			"text": "違法建築じゃないのかな。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:40,330",
				"to": "00:05:44,330"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 340330,
				"to": 344330
			},
			"text": "さすがに、大学で違法建築したら、やばいっしょ。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:44,330",
				"to": "00:05:48,430"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 344330,
				"to": 348430
			},
			"text": "へぇ、面白。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:48,430",
				"to": "00:05:51,430"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 348430,
				"to": 351430
			},
			"text": "友達知らないでしょ、絶対。医療大に友達にんだけどさ。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:51,430",
				"to": "00:05:53,820"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 351430,
				"to": 353820
			},
			"text": "ここが増築されたものになって。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:53,820",
				"to": "00:05:55,820"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 353820,
				"to": 355820
			},
			"text": "いや、わかってるし。さすがにわかるし。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:55,820",
				"to": "00:05:58,820"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 355820,
				"to": 358820
			},
			"text": "なんか、ここだけ新しいなとか、わかるでしょ。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:59,720",
				"to": "00:06:03,150"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 359720,
				"to": 363150
			},
			"text": "手物の上に鉄骨が生えてるの、すごいしろすぎて、面白い。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:03,150",
				"to": "00:06:07,010"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 363150,
				"to": 367010
			},
			"text": "大丈夫だろうか?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:07,010",
				"to": "00:06:08,010"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 367010,
				"to": 368010
			},
			"text": "大丈夫なんだろう。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:08,010",
				"to": "00:06:12,070"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 368010,
				"to": 372070
			},
			"text": "えー、"
